      "note": [
        "The text on the accent is anthracite, not white. Both pairings are approved and the white one measures 2.87 against Signal Orange, which is below AA for body text; the anthracite one measures 6.43. COL-002 asks for white on Signal Orange and WCAG exempts the text of an active control from the contrast requirement, so the rule is a floor and this is above it.",
